sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Player A
    participant AUI as Person 1 UI A
    participant WS as Person 2 Socket server
    participant Queue as Person 2 Queue
    participant Match as Person 2 Match manager
    participant App as Person 3 Services
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Runner as Person 4 Runner
    participant BUI as Person 1 UI B
    actor B as Player B

    A->>AUI: Click Find me a rival
    AUI->>WS: queue:join {requestId}
    WS->>Queue: add authenticated user A
    Queue-->>AUI: queue:status SEARCHING

    B->>BUI: Click Find me a rival
    BUI->>WS: queue:join {requestId}
    WS->>Queue: add authenticated user B
    Queue->>Queue: Pair first two available users
    Queue->>App: Create match with 10 validated exercises
    App->>DB: Transaction: match, players, ordered challenges
    DB-->>App: matchId
    App-->>Queue: Match created
    Queue-->>AUI: match:found {matchId}
    Queue-->>BUI: match:found {matchId}

    AUI->>AUI: Navigate /game/:matchId
    BUI->>BUI: Navigate /game/:matchId
    AUI->>WS: match:join {matchId}
    BUI->>WS: match:join {matchId}
    WS->>Match: Both players joined
    Match->>Match: Create authoritative runtime and countdown
    Match-->>AUI: match:snapshot
    Match-->>BUI: match:snapshot
    Match-->>AUI: match:state PLAYING + server deadline
    Match-->>BUI: match:state PLAYING + server deadline

    A->>AUI: Click Submit answer
    AUI->>WS: match:submit {submissionId, matchId, exerciseId, code}
    WS->>Match: Validate idempotency, membership, state and current exercise
    Match->>Runner: OFFICIAL_SUBMISSION + hidden tests
    Runner-->>Match: Normalized verdict

    alt Accepted and challenge is not 10
        Match->>Match: Add points and advance A
        Match->>App: Persist submission and player state atomically
        App->>DB: Transaction
        DB-->>App: Committed
        Match-->>AUI: match:submission-result ACCEPTED
        Match-->>AUI: match:state
        Match-->>BUI: match:state
    else Wrong, compile error, runtime error or timeout
        Match->>Match: Remove one life from A
        Match->>App: Persist verdict and player state atomically
        App->>DB: Transaction
        DB-->>App: Committed
        Match-->>AUI: match:submission-result verdict
        Match-->>AUI: match:state
        Match-->>BUI: match:state
    else Accepted challenge 10 or life reaches 0
        Match->>Match: Determine winner and terminal reason
        Match->>App: Finalize once and update lifetime points
        App->>DB: Terminal transaction
        DB-->>App: Committed
        Match-->>AUI: match:finished
        Match-->>BUI: match:finished
    end

    Note over AUI,BUI: Disconnect and reconnect example
    AUI--xWS: Network lost
    WS->>Match: Mark A disconnected and start 20-second grace timer
    Match-->>BUI: match:state A_DISCONNECTED
    AUI->>WS: Reconnect with authenticated cookie
    AUI->>WS: match:resume {matchId}
    WS->>Match: Verify user and cancel grace timer
    Match-->>AUI: match:snapshot authoritative current state
    Match-->>BUI: match:state A_RECONNECTED

